cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying analyses, please cite the paper below."
title: "Code and analyses for: The development of subsistence effort and skill among BaYaka foragers"
abstract: >-
  Bayesian hierarchical model jointly estimating subsistence effort, success,
  and food production from a 6-week observational study of BaYaka foragers in
  the Republic of the Congo. Includes Shapley-value decomposition of group
  returns, age measurement-error sensitivity, and aggregation-method sensitivity
  analyses.
